  <data name="s1c7bed2ccaaf095956386a14" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Every source file must match its retained crate archive and Cargo checksum evidence. Modified, unverified or credential-bearing crates are blocked. Archives, registry indexes, installed tools and configuration are retained.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s1dd0dcfdc03b4d5c6f7fae91" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Generated source is allowed only inside verified build-script OUT_DIR after Git and process checks. Preserve manual edits, custom deliverables and files that cannot be rebuilt.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="sfbc8645835ece71611932b55" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Swift builds first. Only verified debug or release product directories are targeted; source checkouts, repositories, credentials and package configuration are retained. Preserve custom products and manual edits to generated source.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="sc8461214470857cbc8974fa3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: select explicitly and stop CMake, Ninja, Make and compiler tasks first. Compiler probe source is allowed only in a verified CMake layout. Preserve authored files, custom binaries and outputs that cannot be rebuilt.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="sa8b26523984a270b3f78183d" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: select explicitly and stop Flutter, Dart and platform builds first. A pubspec.yaml project marker is required. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve deployment outputs and local edits.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s33a74bfb9e63ffb7430ada08" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: select explicitly and stop Gradle or Java tasks first. Only projects with a Gradle build file qualify. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve custom deliverables and offline dependencies.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s8df0a84cbd174fae11a286d8" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: select explicitly and stop Maven or Java tasks first. Generated source requires Maven build metadata. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve custom deliverables and local edits.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s257d8ef694e38c6ebfbb9955" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>High risk: select explicitly and stop Node.js tasks first. Build and dist can contain published deliverables. Only recognized generated bundle names may bypass source protection; preserve authored scripts, tracked files, credentials and outputs that cannot be rebuilt.</value>
  </data>
