  <data name="s30b1071510017bff73684bf7" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only bounded relative metadata and your answers are sent to the disclosed services. File contents are excluded. No automatic deletion.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s2df576c663a220a71787a588" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only explicit cache subdirectories are included. Preserve profiles, credentials, environments and source projects. Close the owning tool before cleanup.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s11c4d284d47b22773ea6368e" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only finished records are removed. Files stay in place; recoverable and unfinished records are kept.</value>
