  <data name="s2172af994fae9e627052f8bc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only records are removed. Files stay in place, but Shou can no longer restore or verify these records.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="sc24a2e6b027b54c4a6ae5d8c" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only rule paths are measured, within the discovery depth and scan budget. This is not a full workspace space analysis. Editing any field requires a new preview.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="s79df832561c2bb76e771e41d" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Only the listed application directories and two levels of folders are checked. Embedded apps, package receipts and custom installation locations are not enumerated.</value>
